  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase 1: OECD is carrying out a regional study on trade in services in South Eastern Europe. The study will be carried out in collaboration with the Stability Pact.  Phase 2: OECD is assisting in setting up a regional framework for trade in services and capacity building in the countries for negotiations and implementation of reforms.</narrative>
